msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「Hello, this is Dragon.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hola, aquí Dragón.」"

msgid "Ami「Hello. This is Venus. What's the sitch,＿Dragon?」"
msgstr "Ami「Hola. Aquí Venus. ¿Cuál＿es el reporte, Dragón?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Things are going smoothly, Venus......＿Wait, is there a meaning to my＿codename?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Todo marcha sobre ruedas, Venus......＿Espera, ¿mi nombre en clave tiene＿algún significado?」"

msgid "Ami「It fits the mood...... Oh, Tiger spotted, 3＿o'clock～」"
msgstr "Ami「Va con el ambiente...... Ah,＿Tigre avistado, a las 3～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mmm......?」"

msgid "Kitamura「There's still some time before the＿show starts. Did we get here a little too＿early, perhaps?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Todavía falta tiempo para que empiece＿la función. ¿Habremos llegado demasiado＿temprano, quizá?」"

msgid "Taiga「N-Not at all. I, I think we're right on＿time!」"
msgstr "Taiga「P-Para nada. ¡Y-Yo creo que＿llegamos justo a tiempo!」"

msgid "Kitamura「It's just like the rumors said. This＿lobby has a great atmosphere to it.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Es tal como decían los rumores. Este＿vestíbulo tiene un gran ambiente.」"

msgid "Taiga「Y-Yeah, it's questionable to say the＿least! I'm glad I came too!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡S-Sí, es cuestionable por decir lo＿menos! ¡También me alegra haber venido!」"

msgid "Taiga「I know of a great place to sit! I'll guide＿you there!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Conozco un gran lugar para sentarse!＿¡Te guiaré hasta allá!」"

msgid "Kitamura「What? Have you been here before,＿Aisaka?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Qué? ¿Ya habías venido antes, Aisaka?」"

msgid "Taiga「Uhh......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ehh......」"

msgid "Kitamura「No matter. If you know where to sit,＿then by all means, show me the way.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「No importa. Si sabes dónde＿sentarnos, entonces adelante,＿muéstrame el camino.」"

msgid "Taiga「L-Leave it to me!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡D-Déjamelo a mí!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Seems like it's going well......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Parece que va bien......」"

msgid "Kota「Sakura-chan, hurry, hurry～」"
msgstr "Kota「Sakura-chan, rápido, rápido～」"

msgid "Sakura「Grr! Kota-kun, wait for meee～」"
msgstr "Sakura「¡Grr! ¡Kota-kun, espérameee～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, the decoys are here.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, llegaron los señuelos.」"

msgid "Sakura「I'm just glad we're on time! I'm a little＿sweaty.」"
msgstr "Sakura「¡Qué alivio que llegamos＿a tiempo! Sudé un poco.」"

msgid "Kota「Sorry, that plush toy I won was slowing＿you down......」"
msgstr "Kota「Perdón, ese peluche que gané＿te estaba retrasando......」"

msgid "Sakura「No, the way you handled the crane was＿amazing, Kota-kun! I'll cherish this＿rabbit you gave me.」"
msgstr "Sakura「¡No, cómo manejaste la garra fue＿increíble, Kota-kun! Cuidaré mucho＿este conejo que me diste.」"

msgid "Kota「Ehehe, okay...... Hey, Sakura-chan.」"
msgstr "Kota「Jejeje, claro...... Oye, Sakura-chan.」"

msgid "Sakura「What is it?」"
msgstr "Sakura「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Kota「......Let's hold hands.」"
msgstr "Kota「......Tomémonos de la mano.」"

msgid "Sakura「......! O-Okay......」"
msgstr "Sakura「......! E-Está bien......」"

msgid "Ami「Tiger's in position. Third seat from the＿front. She's as stiff as always. Things＿look SUPER risky.」"
msgstr "Ami「Tigre está en posición. Tercer asiento＿desde el frente. Está tan tiesa como＿siempre. Esto se ve SÚPER arriesgado.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「As long as everything's going as＿planned...... By the way, Kawashima-- er,＿Venus, where are you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mientras todo marche según el plan......＿Por cierto, Kawashima-- digo, Venus,＿¿dónde estás?」"

msgid "Ami「In the VIP room ① The view is epic!＿The people below look like ants from＿here!」"
msgstr "Ami「En la sala VIP ① ¡La vista es＿épica! ¡La gente de abajo parece＿hormigas desde aquí!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay, leave it to me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien, déjamelo a mí.」"

msgid "Sumire「HEY! Takasu!」"
msgstr "Sumire「¡OYE! ¡Takasu!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, hey!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ah, hola!」"

msgid "Sumire「That Kota bastard...... Showing off their＿fuckin' hand-holding.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Ese desgraciado de Kota......＿Presumiendo que van tomados＿de la maldita mano.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So you ARE concerned about them,＿huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así que SÍ te preocupan, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Sumire「Did you say something?」"
msgstr "Sumire「¿Dijiste algo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Nothing at all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Nada de nada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Where would you like to sit?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Dónde te gustaría sentarte?」"

msgid "Sumire「I don't really care where we sit...... What＿strangely indecent seating, these＿\"loveseats.\"」"
msgstr "Sumire「No me importa dónde sentarnos......＿Qué asientos tan extrañamente＿indecentes, estos \"sofás dobles\".」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's the point......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Esa es la idea......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（............）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（............）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（W-Where's the signal?!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡¿D-Dónde está la señal?!）」"

msgid "Sumire「Hey, where are we sitting?」"
msgstr "Sumire「Oye, ¿dónde nos sentamos?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hmm, let's see. Uhhh, ummm...... That＿one would let us stretch our legs.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mmm, veamos. Ehhh, mmm...... En ese＿podríamos estirar las piernas.」"

msgid "Sumire「Okay......」"
msgstr "Sumire「Está bien......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait, but it would be easier to see＿Tomiie from that seat there.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Espera, pero sería más fácil ver a＿Tomiie desde aquel asiento de allá.」"

msgid "Sumire「Alright.」"
msgstr "Sumire「De acuerdo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, actually, that seat......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, en realidad, ese asiento......」"

msgid "Sumire「ARGH!! I said I don't care! Just decide＿already!!」"
msgstr "Sumire「¡¡ARGH!! ¡Dije que no me importa!＿¡¡Decídete ya!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Okay!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡E-Está bien!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What the hell are you doing, Taiga?!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡¿Qué diablos estás haciendo, Taiga?!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（There!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Ahí!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ohh! That seat over there looks good!＿The third from the front!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ohh! ¡Ese asiento de allá se ve bien!＿¡El tercero desde el frente!」"

msgid "Sumire「Alright, then it's decided. I won't accept＿any more changes!」"
msgstr "Sumire「Bien, entonces está decidido.＿¡No aceptaré más cambios!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay. Please head on over there and＿I'll go buy us some juice.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien. Por favor ve yendo hacia allá y＿yo iré a comprarnos algo de jugo.」"

msgid "Sumire「You should have bought something＿like that earlier. Sheesh, you're＿unprepared. I'll go sit down and wait.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Debiste haber comprado algo así antes.＿Caray, qué poco preparado eres. Iré＿a sentarme a esperar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Whew...... Still going as planned＿somehow. Guess I'll see how she's＿doing in that seat.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Uff...... De algún modo sigue＿según el plan. Supongo que veré＿cómo le va en ese asiento.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Doesn't look like she's going to＿leave...... Does that mean things worked＿out with Kitamura?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No parece que vaya a irse......＿¿Significa eso que las cosas salieron＿bien con Kitamura?）」"

msgid "Taiga「Is this seat taken?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Está ocupado este asiento?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, hey Taiga. Go ahead. Looks like＿Senpai isn't leaving, so I guess our＿plan was a success.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, hola, Taiga. Adelante. Parece que＿Senpai no se va, así que supongo que＿nuestro plan fue un éxito.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Yeah.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You took so long standing up that it＿was hell for me. Kanou-senpai was＿pissed at me for stalling so much.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tardaste tanto en levantarte que fue un＿infierno para mí. Kanou-senpai se enojó＿conmigo por hacer tanto tiempo.」"

msgid "Taiga「The conversation I had with Kitamura＿dragged on, so my timing was thrown＿off.」"
msgstr "Taiga「La conversación que tuve con Kitamura＿se alargó y perdí el momento justo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, what's wrong? You seem down.＿Did something happen with Kitamura?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga, ¿qué pasa? Te ves decaída.＿¿Pasó algo con Kitamura?」"

msgid "Taiga「Not really. I'm just tired. Man, I'm＿getting hungry. Ryuuji, did you bring＿any food with you?」"
msgstr "Taiga「En realidad no. Solo estoy cansada.＿Vaya, me está dando hambre. Ryuuji,＿¿trajiste algo de comida?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You want food all of a sudden......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Quieres comida así de repente......?」"

msgid "I don't have any so I'll buy some"
msgstr "No tengo nada, así que compraré algo"

msgid "How about the cookies I got from you?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal las galletas que me diste?"

msgid "Read this and take your mind off of it"
msgstr "Lee esto y distráete un poco"

msgid "Ryuuji「How about the cookies I got from you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué tal las galletas que me diste?」"

msgid "Taiga「Huh......? I can eat them?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Eh......? ¿Me las puedo comer?」"

msgid "Taiga「But I gave these to you back in＿December. Are they still okay?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Pero te las di allá por diciembre.＿¿Todavía están buenas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......They're individually wrapped, so＿they should be fine. And look, here's＿the expiration date.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Vienen envueltas una por una,＿así que deberían estar bien. Y mira,＿aquí está la fecha de caducidad.」"

msgid "Taiga「You're right. Thanks for the food......!＿Ah, yum♪」"
msgstr "Taiga「Es cierto. ¡Gracias por la comida......!＿Ah, qué rico♪」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You were bummed out until a moment＿ago, and now all of a sudden you're＿happy as a friggin' clam.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hasta hace un momento estabas decaída,＿y de repente estás feliz de la vida.」"

msgid "Taiga「I told you, I'm just tired! Hey, give me＿one more.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Te dije que solo estoy cansada!＿Oye, dame otra más.」"

msgid "Taiga「Right? These are the best.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Verdad? Son lo mejor.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That reminds me, we once ate cookies＿that had salt in them instead of sugar.＿They had a fairly disastrous taste......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso me recuerda que una vez comimos＿galletas con sal en vez de azúcar. Su＿sabor era bastante desastroso......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Cookies with salt instead of sugar......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Galletas con sal en lugar＿de azúcar......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I'm sure I ate them. Those cookies had＿such an intense flavor...... It was at＿school, as I recall......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Seguro que las comí. Esas galletas＿tenían un sabor tan intenso...... Fue＿en la escuela, según recuerdo......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（The cookies were neatly wrapped in＿order to be given as a gift...... Who＿made them?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Las galletas estaban bien envueltas＿para darlas como regalo......＿¿Quién las hizo?）」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji? What's wrong? You realize you＿look kinda stupid glaring at cookies＿like that, right?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Ryuuji? ¿Qué pasa? Te das cuenta＿de que te ves algo tonto mirando＿así unas galletas, ¿no?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Taiga, let's step outside.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Taiga, salgamos un momento.」"

msgid "Taiga「Excuse me? You're about to get your＿pedigree......」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Disculpa? Estás a punto de＿conseguir tu pedigrí......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Let's just go!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Vámonos ya!」"

msgid "Taiga「......!」"
msgstr "Taiga「......!」"

msgid "Taiga「......So what is it?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Y bien, qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga...... You made them, didn't you......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga...... Tú las hiciste,＿¿verdad......?」"

msgid "Taiga「Made what?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Hice qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's right, you did make the cookies＿with salt instead of sugar.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es cierto, tú hiciste las galletas＿con sal en vez de azúcar.」"

msgid "Taiga「......!」"
msgstr "Taiga「......!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It was a practice batch of cookies......＿You wanted to...... to give them to--」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eran unas galletas de prueba......＿Querías...... querías dárselas a--」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kitamura.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kitamura.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I remember now. You...... You've always＿liked Kitamura!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya lo recuerdo. Tú...... ¡Siempre＿te ha gustado Kitamura!」"

msgid "Taiga「Why would you remember that now of＿all times, you idiot!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Por qué tenías que recordar＿eso justo ahora, idiota?!」"

msgid "Taiga「As if I could say something like that to＿you when you don't even know＿anything!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Como si pudiera decirte algo así＿cuando ni siquiera sabes nada!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why not \"I like Kitamura so I don't want＿to\"?! Or \"I don't want him with Kanou＿Sumire\"?!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Por qué no \"Me gusta Kitamura,＿así que no quiero\"?! ¡¿O \"No lo＿quiero con Kanou Sumire\"?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「If you'd said something like that, I'd＿never have asked you to do something＿like this!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Si hubieras dicho algo así,＿jamás te habría pedido que hicieras＿algo como esto!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then why would you agree to help play＿Cupid for her and Kitamura?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Entonces por qué aceptaste ayudar a＿hacer de Cupido entre ella y Kitamura?」"

msgid "Taiga「Well......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I'm going to go check on Kitamura＿and Kanou-senpai.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Iré a ver cómo están＿Kitamura y Kanou-senpai.」"

msgid "Taiga「Why would you do that!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Por qué harías eso?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「To tell them everything we've done and＿apologize to them.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Para contarles todo lo que hicimos＿y disculparme con ellos.」"

msgid "Taiga「So everything we've done up until now＿will be meaningless? Is this the extent＿of your feelings for Kitamura!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Entonces todo lo que hicimos hasta＿ahora no servirá de nada? ¡¿Hasta ahí＿llegan tus sentimientos por Kitamura?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then, what about you!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Y entonces qué hay de ti?!」"

msgid "Taiga「......I'm going home.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Me voy a casa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「H-Hey!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡O-Oye!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait up, Taiga!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Espera, Taiga!」"

msgid "Ami「What's the problem? What's going on＿with you two?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Cuál es el problema? ¿Qué está＿pasando entre ustedes dos?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kawashima, the rest is in your hands.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kawashima, el resto está en tus manos.」"

msgid "Ami「Wha--? Wait, Takasu-kun!」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué--? ¡Espera, Takasu-kun!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Taiga......!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Taiga......!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't have any. Guess I'll go buy some.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No tengo nada. Supongo que＿iré a comprar algo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright. I better not hear your stomach＿growling.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien. Más vale que no escuche＿rugir tu estómago.」"

msgid "Taiga「It's an act of God. I can't help it. If that＿happens, cover it up for me as best＿you can.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Es obra de Dios. No puedo evitarlo.＿Si llega a pasar, cúbreme lo＿mejor que puedas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What do you expect me to do......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué esperas que haga......?」"

msgid "Loudspeaker「Thank you for waiting. The show will＿now begin. Everyone, please take your＿seats and look at the screen.」"
msgstr "Altavoz「Gracias por esperar. La función está＿por comenzar. Por favor, tomen asiento＿y miren hacia la pantalla.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, it's starting.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ya empieza.」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm a little excited.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Estoy un poco emocionada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I wonder what Kitamura and＿Kanou-senpai are talking about while＿they gaze up at this starry sky......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Me pregunto de qué estarán hablando＿Kitamura y Kanou-senpai mientras＿contemplan este cielo estrellado......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry, I don't have any food. I'll give you＿this instead.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón, no tengo nada de comida.＿Te daré esto en su lugar.」"

msgid "Taiga「What's this, a sports magazine!? What＿do you expect me to do with this?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Qué es esto, una revista deportiva?!＿¡¿Qué esperas que haga con esto?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The show's about to start, so there's＿no time to go buy anything. You can＿read that to take your mind off of it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「La función ya va a empezar, así que no＿hay tiempo para ir a comprar nada. Lee＿eso para distraerte un poco.」"

msgid "Taiga「This isn't going to help!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Esto no va a ayudar!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Your star sign is first in the horoscope＿section.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tu signo es el primero en la＿sección del horóscopo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Really!? Let's see......」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿En serio?! A ver......」"

msgid "Taiga「Wait, these horoscopes are old!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Espera, estos horóscopos son viejos!」"

msgid "Loudspeaker「Thank you for waiting. The show will＿now begin. Everyone, please take your＿seats and look at the screen.」"
msgstr "Altavoz「Gracias por esperar. La función está＿por comenzar. Por favor, tomen asiento＿y miren hacia la pantalla.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey, it's starting.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, ya empieza.」"

msgid "Taiga「......I'm hungry.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Tengo hambre.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Are you still on about that......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Sigues con eso......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I wonder what Kitamura and＿Kanou-senpai are talking about as＿they gaze up at this starry sky......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Me pregunto de qué estarán hablando＿Kitamura y Kanou-senpai al contemplar＿este cielo estrellado......）」"

msgid "Taiga「Crap, my phone's ringing.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Rayos, está sonando mi teléfono.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Dummy, it's common sense to turn＿your phone off in a place like this!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Tonta, es de sentido común apagar el＿teléfono en un lugar como este!」"

msgid "Taiga「I know that! I just forgot to! ......Oh,＿Yacchan's calling.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ya lo sé! ¡Solo se me olvidó! ......Ah,＿está llamando Yacchan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yasuko? Why would she call you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Yasuko? ¿Por qué te llamaría a ti?」"

msgid "Taiga「Probably because she can't reach＿yours, right? It might be an＿emergency.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Seguro porque no entra la llamada al＿tuyo, ¿no? Podría ser una emergencia.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「We can't answer it here, so let's go out＿into the lobby.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No podemos contestar aquí, así＿que salgamos al vestíbulo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hello? Yacchan? What's wrong?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Hola? ¿Yacchan? ¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Taiga「......What!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¡¿Qué?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What's wrong? What happened?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué pasa? ¿Qué ocurrió?」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji, this is bad! She said Inko-chan's＿gone missing!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ryuuji, esto es malo! ¡Dijo＿que Inko-chan desapareció!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Missing!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Desapareció?!」"

msgid "Taiga「Yacchan said apparently the birdcage＿door was open, so it probably escaped.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Yacchan dijo que al parecer la puerta＿de la jaula estaba abierta, así＿que seguro se escapó.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Don't tell me it was kidnapped......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿No me digas que lo＿secuestraron......?」"

msgid "Taiga「Why would anyone kidnap the ugliest＿bird that ever lived from that＿run-down old shack?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Por qué alguien secuestraría al＿pájaro más feo del mundo de esa＿choza vieja y destartalada?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't know, maybe they stole it to use＿as a food source!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No sé, tal vez se lo robaron＿para usarlo como alimento!」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't get ahead of yourself! Just calm＿down. Isn't it possible it's just＿wandering around the neighborhood?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No te adelantes! Solo cálmate.＿¿No es posible que solo esté dando＿vueltas por el vecindario?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Dammit, I don't need this right now!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¡Maldición, no necesito esto ahora!!」"

msgid "Taiga「Huh? Where are you going!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Eh? ¡¿A dónde vas?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm gonna go looking for Inko-chan,＿obviously!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Voy a ir a buscar a Inko-chan,＿obviamente!」"

msgid "Taiga「What about Kitamura-kun and Kanou＿Sumire!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Y qué hay de Kitamura-kun＿y Kanou Sumire?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「They've come this far, so they should＿be okay. The rest is up to you and＿Kawashima! See ya!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya llegaron hasta aquí, así que estarán＿bien. ¡El resto queda en manos tuyas＿y de Kawashima! ¡Nos vemos!」"

msgid "Taiga「Wait, Ryuuji!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Espera, Ryuuji!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Please be safe, Inko-chan......!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Por favor, que estés a salvo,＿Inko-chan......!）」"

msgid "Kitamura「I feel bad that Takasu's stuck in bed,＿but I'm glad I got to come here with＿you, Aisaka.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Me da pena que Takasu esté en＿cama, pero me alegra haber podido＿venir contigo, Aisaka.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Coming here with another guy is a＿little weird.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Venir aquí con otro chico＿resulta un poco raro.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Ha ha ha. It's just like you to agree with＿me.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ja, ja, ja. Es tan propio＿de ti darme la razón.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Now then, it would appear we can sit＿and wait inside rather than out here in＿the lobby. Let's go.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Bueno, parece que podemos sentarnos＿a esperar adentro en lugar de aquí＿en el vestíbulo. Vamos.」"

msgid "Kota「We made it......! Ack, sorry, looks like I＿was 10 minutes off about the start＿time.」"
msgstr "Kota「¡Llegamos......! Ay, perdón, parece＿que me equivoqué por 10 minutos＿con la hora de inicio.」"

msgid "Kota「We could have taken our time walking＿here with no problem.」"
msgstr "Kota「Pudimos venir caminando con＿calma sin ningún problema.」"

msgid "Ami「When Tiger gets out of her seat, I'll＿signal you twice with the flashlight.」"
msgstr "Ami「Cuando Tigre se levante de su asiento,＿te haré dos señales con la linterna.」"

msgid "Ami「Then you lead Kanou Sumire to where＿Yuusaku's sitting.」"
msgstr "Ami「Luego llevas a Kanou Sumire a＿donde está sentado Yuusaku.」"

msgid "Sumire「I thought you were in the restroom.＿What the hell are you muttering about＿over here? We're going inside.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Pensé que estabas en el baño.＿¿Qué diablos estás murmurando＿por aquí? Vamos adentro.」"

msgid "Sumire「Look, Sakura and Kota are here too!」"
msgstr "Sumire「¡Mira, también están Sakura y Kota!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（According to the plan, Taiga will＿casually get up and leave Kitamura＿sitting alone......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Según el plan, Taiga se levantará＿con naturalidad y dejará a Kitamura＿sentado solo......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（And I'll put Kanou Sumire in her place!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Y yo pondré a Kanou＿Sumire en su lugar!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「This is all I have on me right now. Plus,＿I'm not going to remember anything＿just by holding onto these, so they're」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es todo lo que traigo encima ahora.＿Además, no voy a recordar nada solo por＿guardarlas, así que no son」"

msgid "Ryuuji「not particularly critical.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「especialmente importantes.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Are they that good? I'll have one too.＿Let's see...... Ohh, they're sweet,＿crunchy, and have a great buttery」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Están tan buenas? Probaré una también.＿A ver...... Ohh, son dulces, crujientes＿y tienen un gran sabor a」"

msgid "Ryuuji「flavor. These are expertly made.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「mantequilla. Están hechas con maestría.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're the idiot here! Why did you＿agree to help me and Kawashima with＿this plan? You should have said」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Tú eres la idiota! ¿Por qué aceptaste＿ayudarnos a Kawashima y a mí con este＿plan? ¡Debiste haber dicho」"

msgid "Ryuuji「something!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「algo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You had a big fight with Kanou Sumire＿on the day of the student council＿election...... because she rejected」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tuviste una gran pelea con Kanou Sumire＿el día de la elección del consejo＿estudiantil...... ¿porque ella rechazó a」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kitamura? Is that why?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kitamura? ¿Es por eso?」"

msgid "Taiga「Wrong! Back then, she hurt＿Kitamura-kun in the most cowardly＿way possible! I just couldn't forgive her」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No! En ese momento hirió a Kitamura-kun＿del modo más cobarde posible. ¡No podía＿perdonarla」"

msgid "Taiga「for running away like that!」"
msgstr "Taiga「por huir así!」"

msgid "Taiga「Excuse me? What are you saying? We＿went through so much to get＿Kitamura-kun and Kanou Sumire to」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Disculpa? ¿Qué estás diciendo?＿Pasamos por tanto para que Kitamura-kun＿y Kanou Sumire」"

msgid "Taiga「face each other, and now you're going＿to interfere!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「se vieran cara a cara, ¡¿y＿ahora vas a interferir?!」"

msgid "Taiga「If you don't have any, then forget it.＿Wouldn't want your clumsy movements＿to attract attention from Kitamura-kun」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si no tienes, olvídalo. No quisiera que＿tus movimientos torpes llamen la＿atención de Kitamura-kun」"

msgid "Taiga「or Kanou Sumire.」"
msgstr "Taiga「o de Kanou Sumire.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Escaped? Inko-chan? That's not＿possible. I carefully, carefully nurtured＿Inko-chan like a member of our family」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Escapó? ¿Inko-chan? Eso es imposible.＿¡Yo crié con muchísimo cuidado a＿Inko-chan como parte de la familia」"

msgid "Ryuuji「ever since it was a chick! It can't have＿escaped......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「desde que era un polluelo! No＿pudo haberse escapado......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What if some weirdo grabbed it!? With＿a face like that, it's possible Inko-chan＿was mistaken for a rare new species」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Y si algún tipo raro lo atrapó?! Con＿esa cara, es posible que confundieran a＿Inko-chan con una rara especie nueva」"

msgid "Ryuuji「and hauled off for a vivisection......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「y se lo llevaran para una＿vivisección......」"
